# pi writes runtime state (auth, sessions, node_modules, caches, npm
# package.json/lock) into this dir at runtime; only track the config files
# we actually want versioned. settings.json's "packages" array is the source
# of truth — pi regenerates npm/* from it on startup.
*
!.gitignore
!agent/
agent/*
!agent/settings.json
!agent/models.json
!agent/AGENTS.md
